{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/Gif04.gif?t=1743940175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demon Hunt is a 3D top down bullet-heaven with action roguelite elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a  sci-fi fantasy world, you'll face relentless hordes of demons and intense boss battles as you fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Slay enemies, collect experience, level up and gain skill points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Use skill points to to upgrade your weapons or acquire new weapons, new artifacts after each wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Evolve your weapons through unique ability branches, unlocking stronger forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Engage in boss battles and defeat the final demon boss  mark to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Spend your resources in your base after hunts to unlock orbs to gain permanent abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Loot and equip items from dead enemies to gain permanent stat upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Recycle, buy and craft items in your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Unlock new mecha classes, advance through their talent trees and try different builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/extras/Gif03.gif?t=1743940175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Demon Hunt is a solo developer project</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039910?t=1743940175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3039910?t=1743940175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039910/296a454a4cdcac4c89e8d72e6b3f7e9c4be2e041/capsule_231x87.jpg?